From ba33df5e4918843b889f96f15c6284af254cdf97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:49:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] proto(s2a-p2a): admit affine writes and policy-checked
 scatter (admitSourceAffine)

AdmittedOutput gains forms (one WriteForm per destination axis) tied to dest by
FormsSpec (admitOutput_formsSpec, admitAffineOutput_formsSpec). New causes
writeOutOfRange and unsupported scatterPolicy. admitSource is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
